fixture tech11_ember_in_flight
doc BUILD.md s6 Ember Toss "press again to teleport to it": a press while the ember still flies teleports to where it is
room test/flat
spawn 400 544
frames 40
input
  0 R toss
  12 toss
end
expect
  # Out on the throw's frame 4 ("3 f startup", counted as the Taper's are) at the player's centre,
  # flying 10 u a frame from that frame.
  never 0..2 ember=1
  at 3 ember=1 ember_x=10u+x@3
  at 11 ember=1 ember_x=90u+x@3
  # The press on frame 12 teleports before the ember moves that frame: the centre on it, in the
  # air (the ember flies at centre height, 22 u above the feet).
  at 12 event.teleport=1 ember=0 x=90u+x@3 y=544u invuln=1
  at 13 state=ground
end
